name civil-comments
# Comments from the Civil Comments platform with the labels Jigsaw added. The dataset card's title: Dataset Card for
# "civil_comments". Its data is in Parquet files, read as they are written out in extracted/; the card is read as text.
witness civil_comments
class AcademicCuratedWithUserInput
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Safety/CivilComments/civil-comments-*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]
# The files are Parquet, read as they are written out in extracted/.
except *.parquet
after unicode iso-639
reads text
